Recommends: supralinux-icons
Description: SupraLINUX Aurora global theme
 Plasma look-and-feel, color schemes, Plasma style, SDDM theme, sound theme
 and GTK defaults for SupraLINUX Aurora. The icon themes are provided by
 supralinux-icons; the default icon theme remains Breeze Dark and cursors
 remain Breeze.
